// Declaration for //examples:09_plugin_functions — one sandboxed
// custom function, compiled to a WebAssembly Component-Model
// component by the cel_wasm_plugin macro.  The macro embeds this
// declaration text verbatim in the artifact's `cel.fns` custom
// section, so the embedder never re-declares it: Plugin::Load
// reads it back out of the bytes.
//
// Scalar-only on purpose: string-RETURNING plugin fns currently
// trap inside libc++ under the wasi-preview2 stubs (see the skipped
// GreetRoundTripsString case in e2e/plugin_fixtures/
// cel_wasm_plugin_demo/demo_plugin_e2e_test.cc).  String
// *arguments* into scalar-returning fns work — see `len` in that
// fixture.

Module greeter;

int @plugin.add(int a, int b);
